Why it was obvious: Will's direction was to codify from the actual cycles, not invent a process (2026-11-15 22:21 CST): 'look at all of the integration / open build cycles I've posted on chat recently - codify a state machine that proceeds through the full life cycle whenever this opportunity comes up.' Nine cycles surveyed from 2026-11-07 to 2026-11-15 supplied the stages; the invariants (never self-originated, registered before it starts, at least one Will-gate in every cycle, gaps are a deliverable) are the surveyed cycles' common discipline made explicit.

