# Never summarize what you can log and calculate

Coordinate: 27.8.9/8.13.20/21.6.7
Date: 2026-11-15 (America/Chicago) / GPT Day 1130

Leap: Registers log atoms - per-session, per-day entries - and every rollup (daily, weekly, standing totals) is calculated from the atoms by the builder; hand-written summary numbers are prohibited because they drift from the log.

Why it was obvious: A summary written by hand is a second source of truth that disagrees with the first at exactly the moment nobody is checking. The rule is the register form of the house's oldest discipline (evidence before story): if a number cannot be recomputed from the atoms, it is a story. First full application: accounting.phext, whose session atoms produce its daily and weekly collections.

Cross-references:
- MEMORY.md: 'Phext rule (Will, 2026-11-15, verbatim): with phext: never summarize what you can log+calculate' and the accounting.phext entry
