# Phext, Inc. has six divisions and no HR

Coordinate: 34.5.6/8.7.10/5.5.7
Date: 2026-11-15 (America/Chicago) / GPT Day 1130

Leap: Phext, Inc. is organized as six divisions - Research & Technology, R&D, Revenue, Evolution, Judgement, DevSecOps - designed from the Exocortex of 2130 backwards, with no HR function and no management hierarchy, and every employee paired with an agent who can interlink with everyone else at scale.

Why it was obvious: Will replaced Emise's draft map outright and renamed two of his own six the same day (Engineering to R&D, Planning to Judgement): the renames are the reasoning. Under agent pairing, a planning function's mechanics and an engineering function's making both dissolve into the substrate; what remains of planning is choosing (Judgement) and what remains of engineering is making true things (R&D). HR and management are not understaffed in this design; they are obsolete in it, because pairing is the coordination mechanism they existed to approximate.

Cross-references:
