Why it was obvious: Adoption was recorded 2026-11-15 23:56 CST in the PH: Judgement chat, superseding the plan's proposal status. The sequencing reasoning is in the record: the proposal's alternative - ratify SBOR V5 and operate a first Council first - is not available, because SBOR V5 was completed and merged on 2026-11-02 under steward adoption, not ratification, and Will ruled on 2026-10-31 that there aren't enough sentients to form a Council yet; this item therefore proceeds under Will's stewardship.

